  "problem": "The joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $f$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.2$ | $0.6$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.1$ | $0.1$ |\n\nGiven that $\\text{E}[X]=0.2$ and $\\text{E}[Y]=1.4,$ find the covariance matrix for $X$ and $Y.$",
